{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1455352","title":"Ecological fate of influent-derived microorganisms in MBR systems","description":"This project aims to compare influent-derived microorganisms with activated sludge microorganisms in a low-temperature membrane bioreactor (MBR) treating municipal wastewater.Samples were collected from influent wastewater (Inf) , activated sludge (AS), and membrane biofilms (BF) under a range of operational and environmental conditions. In addition to 16S rRNA gene (DNA-based) sequencing, complementary DNA (cDNA) was synthesized and 16S rRNA (RNA-based) sequencing was performed.This dataset enables comparative analyses of microbial community structure, activity, and growth dynamics across sample types (Inf, AS , BF), operational conditions, and nucleic acid types (DNA and RNA).","center":"Nagaoka university of Technology","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/04/19 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN57362809","MIMS Environmental/Metagenome sample from wastewater metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-11-03",2023,"JP","Niigata",1856199,"Nagaoka","verified",37.48,138.85,"Japan:Nagaoka",null,"wastewater","activated_sludge","sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN57362810","MIMS Environmental/Metagenome sample from wastewater metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-12-13",2023,"JP","Niigata",1856199,"Nagaoka","verified",37.48,138.85,"Japan:Nagaoka",null,"wastewater","activated_sludge","sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN57362811","MIMS Environmental/Metagenome sample from wastewater metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-12-22",2023,"JP","Niigata",1856199,"